  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN221.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṟkup pōkkuṭaṉpaṭṭa tōḻi talaimakaṭkup pōkkuṭaṉpaṭac colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante, who had agreed with HIM on eloping, said to HER so that she would agree to eloping.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN221.1">
        <l>naṉaiviḷai naṟaviṉ ṟēṟaṉ māntip</l>
        <l>puṉaiviṉai nalliṟ ṟarumaṇaṟ kuvaiip</l>
        <l>pomma lōti yeṉmakaṇ maṇaṉē</l>
        <l>vatuvai <supplied>ya</supplied>yarntaṉar namarē yataṉāṟ</l>
        <l>putuvatu puṉainta cē<supplied>yi</supplied>lai veṉvē<supplied>ṉ</supplied></l>
        <l>matiyuṭam pa<supplied>ṭ</supplied>ṭa maiyaṇaṟ kāḷai</l>
        <l>vāṅkuciṉaik koyta tiraḷarai marāttut </l>
        <l>tēmpāy melliṇar taḷiroṭu koṇṭuniṉ</l>
        <l>ṟaṇṇaṟu mucci puṉaiya vavaṉoṭu</l>
        <l>kaḻaikaviṉ potiya maḻaiyuyar naṉantalaik</l>
        <l>kaḷiṟṟirai piḻaittaliṟ kayavāy vēṅkai</l>
        <l>kāyciṉañ ciṟantu kuḻumaliṉ verīi</l>
        <l>yirumpiṭi yiriyuñ cōlai</l>
        <l>yaruñcurañ cēṟa layarntaṉeṉ yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">Drinking the cleared juice of toddy matured with buds,</l>
        <l corresp="2">heaping sand brought to the good house of crafty workmanship,</l>
        <l corresp="3">“[this is] the union of my thick-haired daughter”, [thus]</l>
        <l corresp="4">our people have started to prepare the wedding. Therefore,</l>
        <l corresp="5">while, [his] victorious spear with a red leaf[-shaped] tip newly decorated,</l>
        <l corresp="6">the young man with a black beard who is in agreement [with you]</l>
        <l corresp="9a-c">decorates your cool fragrant hair tuft</l>
        <l corresp="8">with the honey-flowing soft clusters and sprouts</l>
        <l corresp="7">of the round-trunked Kadamba tree that are plucked from the bending branches,</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="9d">with him,</l>
        <l corresp="10">in the vast space high with clouds that store the beauty of the bamboo,</l>
        <l corresp="14">I have prepared [your] going to the difficult desert</l>
        <l corresp="13">with groves, where the dark she elephant retreats,</l>
        <l corresp="12">frightened of the roaring excelling in hot anger</l>
        <l corresp="11">of the deep-mouthed tiger because it failed [in having] the elephant bull as [its] prey.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

